g are strong, but interpersonal issue is big. Candidate D's responsibility and concentration are strong, but hot temper is serious for safety.\n\nMaybe Candidate A's leadership and anticipation are valuable, but show-off and not open to new ideas could affect crew. Hard.\n\nWe need to give a recommendation now, can be provisional. Let's pick Candidate B as provisional recommendation, citing strengths and acknowledging concerns, but argue that strengths outweigh concerns, and we can mitigate interpersonal issues with training.\n\nWe must reference existing discussion (none) maybe say \"Given we have not yet discussed, I will start by proposing...\"\n\nOk.\n\nProvide METADATA_JSON with vote \"Candidate B\"."}
